          <h2>Which African Grey Page Do You Need Next?</h2>
          <p class="opener">This page is the hub. Every other for-sale page on the site is a spoke that answers one question in depth, and the boarding pass below lists all of them.</p>

          <nav class="bpass" id="spoke-index" aria-label="Every page in the for-sale cluster">
            <div class="bpass-head"><span class="bp-k">Cluster index</span><span class="bp-route">HUB <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> {spokes.length} SPOKES</span></div>
